---
permalink: ./wh40k-factions.html
title: 战锤40K · 势力谱系
bodyClass: world-wh40k wh-factions-page
pageType: wh40k-factions
worldId: wh40k
cssFiles:
  - base.css
  - nav.css
  - worlds.css
  - wh40k-world.css
  - responsive.css
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<article class="wh-catalog" id="faction-index" aria-labelledby="faction-title">
  <header class="wh-catalog-hero">
    <a class="wh-backlink" href="./wh40k.html">← GALAXY / 破碎银河入口</a>
    <p class="wh-eyebrow">ORDO XENOS / BELLIGERENT INDEX</p>
    <h1 id="faction-title">势力<span>谱系</span></h1>
    <p>九个主要势力分列于此，可查看各自的子势力、编年记录与来源。</p>
    <div class="wh-filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="筛选势力">
      <button class="is-active" type="button" data-faction-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">ALL / 全部</button>
      <button type="button" data-faction-filter="humanity" aria-pressed="false">HUMANITY</button>
      <button type="button" data-faction-filter="warp" aria-pressed="false">WARP</button>
      <button type="button" data-faction-filter="xenos" aria-pressed="false">XENOS</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wh-faction-grid">
    {% for faction in wh40kCatalog.factions %}
    <article class="wh-faction-card" id="{{ faction.id }}" data-faction-id="{{ faction.id }}" data-faction-group="{{ faction.group }}">
      <button class="wh-faction-trigger" type="button" data-faction-toggle="{{ faction.id }}" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{ faction.id }}-detail">
        <span class="wh-faction-code">{{ faction.code }}</span>
        <span class="wh-faction-order">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <strong>{{ faction.name }}</strong>
        <small>{{ faction.latin }}</small>
        <p>{{ faction.tone }}</p>
        <i>打开档案</i>
      </button>
      <div class="wh-faction-detail" id="{{ faction.id }}-detail" hidden>
        <p>{{ faction.summary }}</p>
        <div><span>CHRONICLE LINKS</span><strong>{{ faction.records | length }}</strong></div>
        <div class="wh-record-links" aria-label="{{ faction.name }}编年关联">
          {% for record in faction.records %}
          <a href="./wh40k-chronicle.html#{{ record.id }}"><span>{{ record.dateDisplay }}</span><strong>{{ record.title }}</strong><i>→</i></a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% for source in faction.sources %}<a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">来源 / {{ source.title }} ↗</a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <footer class="wh-catalog-note"><strong>收录说明</strong><p>这里列出与各势力相关的事件；点击即可回到对应记录。</p></footer>
</article>
<noscript><style>.world-wh40k .wh-faction-detail[hidden]{display:block!important}</style></noscript>
{% endblock %}
